{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他想说多喜欢这样，也想问对方是否也一样，没想好怎么开口，念头淡了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他还想靠近，又怕要得太多；对方不知道他刚才有多怕被嫌弃，他有点孤单。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可两个人现在都愿意亲近，以后还会不会这样？他心里没底。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起对方一直没退开，两人眼下还这么亲近；也许对方也喜欢有他陪着，他有点高兴，可心里还是没底。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"轻松过后，他想，自己需要对方，对方也许有时需要他；就算对方不需要，他仍愿意陪着，不再遮掩喜欢。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他顾不上对方是否也在乎自己，只想把能给的都给对方，盼对方安心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"高兴过后，他更想听对方说以后也不变；可越喜欢跟他待着，越觉得时间过得快，真能一直好吗？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他最初连喜欢都不敢多露，如今两人还亲近，心里又甜又酸，却不后悔。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"共修改8条，均为至少两位读者重复指出的措辞问题，改后没有一条长于原句。S03保留了表达喜欢和确认对方是否也有同样感受两个动作，也保留了念头淡去的过程。S06保留了想靠近、怕要得太多，以及对方不知道他曾经多害怕被嫌弃所带来的孤单。S08保留双方当下都愿意亲近、未来却未必如此的具体担忧。S09保留眼前亲近带来的高兴与不安仍在的矛盾，没有采纳删去最后一层不安的建议。S11保留双方可能互相需要，以及即使对方不需要自己仍愿意陪伴的选择。S12保留希望对方安心这一具体动机。S13保留越喜欢相处越感觉时间流逝的切身感受，没有改成单纯追问保证是否可靠。S14保留最初的胆怯、如今仍然亲近、心里的甜酸和不后悔。S07-2只有一位读者提出调整，未修改；其他未达到多人共同指出条件的意见也不采纳。所有当前稿明确胜出的关系推进、情绪转折和最终选择均予以保留。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fd49bc39-f842-4ab0-aed3-7fe90333af43", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T173333558526Z", "elapsed_seconds": 382.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T17:39:56.262471+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "23b091291496c2a85115513cb4416fb96436fc6bf8a85482001929839a1d059d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T173333558526Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "549b0a0b29ecffe5a4ae7bed0877ce79fc845da5ae963c9d7d2e76af5802d974"}}}
